{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_1","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"天文下","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_2","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"史臣曰：天文設象，宜備內外兩宮，但災之所躔，不必遍行景緯，五星精晷與二曜而為七，妖祥是主，曆數攸司，蓋有殊於列宿也。若北辰不移，據在杠軸，眾星動流，實繫天體，五星從伏，〔一〕非關二義，故徐顯思以五星為非星，虞喜論之詳矣。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_3","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五星相犯列宿雜災","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_4","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元元年八月辛亥，太白犯軒轅大星。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_5","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月癸丑，太白從行於軫犯填星。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_6","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年六月丙子，太白晝見。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_7","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年二月丙戌，太白晝見在午上。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_8","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六（年）〔月〕辛卯，〔二〕太白晝見午上。庚子，太白入東井，無所犯。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_9","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月己未，太白有光影。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_10","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月戊子，太白從軒轅犯女主星。甲辰，太白從行犯軒轅少民星。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_11","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月己卯，太白從行犯太微西蕃上將。辛酉，太白從行入太微，在右執法星西北一尺。〔三〕戊辰，太白從行犯太微左執法。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_12","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月壬子，太白從行犯填星，在氐度。丙辰，太白從行犯房北頭第一星。丁卯，太白犯楗閉星。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_13","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明元年六月己酉，太白行犯太微上將星。辛酉，太白行犯太微左執法。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_14","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月甲申，太白犯南斗第四星。","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_15","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月乙酉，太白犯南斗第三星。壬辰，太白熒惑合同在南斗度。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_16","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月丁卯，太白犯哭星。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_17","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年正月戊戌，太白晝見當午上。","sentenceOrder":17},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_18","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月甲戌，太白從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":18},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_19","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月丙申，太白從行犯東井鉞星。","sentenceOrder":19},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_20","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月戊辰，太白熒惑合同在輿鬼度。己巳，太白從行輿鬼度犯歲星。","sentenceOrder":20},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_21","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三年四月丁未，太白晝見。癸亥，太白晝見當午上。","sentenceOrder":21},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_22","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月戊子，太白犯少民星。","sentenceOrder":22},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_23","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月丁巳，太白晝見當午上。","sentenceOrder":23},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_24","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月壬申，太白從行入氐。","sentenceOrder":24},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_25","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月己酉，太白填星合在箕度。","sentenceOrder":25},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_26","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年九月壬辰，太白晝見當午。丙午，太白犯南斗。","sentenceOrder":26},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_27","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月庚子，太白入羽林，又犯天關。","sentenceOrder":27},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_28","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五年五月丁酉，太白晝見當午上。庚子，太白三犯畢左股第一星西南一尺。","sentenceOrder":28},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_29","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月甲戌，太白犯東井北轅第三星，在西一尺。","sentenceOrder":29},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_30","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月甲寅，太白從行入軒轅，在女主星東北一尺二寸，不為犯。戊辰，太白從在太微西蕃上將星西南五寸。辛巳，太白從在太微左執法星西北四寸。","sentenceOrder":30},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_31","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六年四月辛酉，太白從在熒惑北三寸，為犯，並在東井度。","sentenceOrder":31},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_32","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月癸卯，太白晝見當午上。〔四〕","sentenceOrder":32},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_33","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月己巳，太白從在太微西蕃右執法星東南四寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":33},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_34","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月癸巳，太白在氐角星東北一尺，為犯。","sentenceOrder":34},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_35","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月乙亥，太白從行在房南第二左股次將星西南一尺，為犯〔五〕。","sentenceOrder":35},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_36","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"閏八月甲午，太白晝見當午。","sentenceOrder":36},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_37","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月戊午，太白從在歲星西北四尺，同在尾度。又在熒惑東北六尺五寸，在心度，合宿。","sentenceOrder":37},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_38","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月壬寅，太白從行在填星西南二尺五寸斗度。","sentenceOrder":38},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_39","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七年二月辛巳，太白從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":39},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_40","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月癸酉，太白在歲星南，相去一尺六寸，從在箕度為合。","sentenceOrder":40},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_41","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月丁卯，太白從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":41},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_42","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八年正月丁未，太白晝見當午上。","sentenceOrder":42},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_43","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六（年）〔月〕戊子，〔六〕太白從行入東井。己丑，太白晝見當午。","sentenceOrder":43},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_44","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月庚辰，太白從在軒轅女主星南七尺，為犯。","sentenceOrder":44},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_45","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月丙申，太白從行在太微西蕃上將星西南一尺，為犯。丁未，太白從行入太微。辛酉，太白從行在進賢西五寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":45},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_46","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月乙亥，太白從行在亢南第二星西南一尺，為犯。甲申，太白從行入氐。","sentenceOrder":46},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_47","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月戊戌，太白從行在房北頭第二星東北一寸，又在楗閉星西南七寸，並為犯。又在熒惑西北二尺，為合宿。癸卯，太白從行在熒惑東北一尺，為犯。","sentenceOrder":47},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_48","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年四月癸未，太白從歷，夕見西方，從疾參宿一度，比來多陰，至己丑開除，已見在日北，當西北維上，薄昏不見宿星，則為先歷而見。","sentenceOrder":48},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_49","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月丙子，太白晝見當午上。","sentenceOrder":49},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_50","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月辛卯，太白從行入太微，在西蕃上將星北四寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":50},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_51","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月乙亥，太白從行在南斗第四星北二寸，為犯。丁卯，太白在南斗第三星西一寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":51},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_52","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十年二月甲辰，太白從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":52},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_53","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月辛巳，太白從行入東井，在軒轅西第一星東六寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":53},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_54","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月乙丑，太白從行在軒轅大星東八寸，為犯。〔七〕","sentenceOrder":54},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_55","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年正月戊辰，太白從行在歲星西北六寸，為犯，在奎度。","sentenceOrder":55},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_56","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二月丁丑，太白從行東井北轅西頭第一星東北一尺，為犯。","sentenceOrder":56},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_57","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月戊子，太白在五諸侯東第二星西北六寸，為犯。辛丑，太白從行入輿鬼，在東北星西南四寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":57},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_58","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月戊午，太白晝見當午，名為經天。癸亥，太白從行入軒轅大星北一尺二寸，無所犯。","sentenceOrder":58},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_59","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月己酉，太白晝見當午上。","sentenceOrder":59},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_60","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月丙戌，太白行在進賢星西南四寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":60},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_61","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月戊戌，太白從行入氐。丁卯，太白從行在楗閉星西北六寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":61},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_62","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月壬辰，太白從行在南斗第六星東南一尺，為犯。辛丑，太白從行在西建東星西南一尺，為犯。","sentenceOrder":62},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_63","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元元年五月己未，熒惑犯太微西蕃上將，又犯東蕃上將。","sentenceOrder":63},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_64","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年十月辛酉，熒惑守太微。","sentenceOrder":64},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_65","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年六月戊子，熒惑從行入東井，無所犯。戊戌，熒惑在東井度，形色小而黃黑不明。丁丑，熒惑太白同在東井度。","sentenceOrder":65},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_66","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月甲戌，熒惑從行入輿鬼，犯積尸。","sentenceOrder":66},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_67","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月癸未，熒惑從行犯太微西蕃上將星。丙戌，熒惑從入太微。","sentenceOrder":67},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_68","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月丙辰，熒惑（後）〔從〕行在太微，〔八〕犯右執法。","sentenceOrder":68},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_69","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明元年正月己亥，熒惑逆犯上相。辛亥，熒惑守角。庚子，熒惑逆入太微。","sentenceOrder":69},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_70","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月丁卯，熒惑守太白。","sentenceOrder":70},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_71","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月戊申，熒惑從犯亢。己巳，熒惑從行犯氐東南星。","sentenceOrder":71},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_72","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月戊寅，熒惑填星同在氐度。丁亥，熒惑行犯房北頭第二星。","sentenceOrder":72},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_73","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月乙丑，熒惑從行犯天江。甲戌，熒惑犯南斗第五星。","sentenceOrder":73},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_74","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月丙申，熒惑入羽林。","sentenceOrder":74},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_75","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年八月庚午，熒惑犯太微西蕃上將。癸未，熒惑犯太微右執法。丁酉，熒惑犯太微右執法。〔九〕","sentenceOrder":75},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_76","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月庚申，熒惑犯進賢。","sentenceOrder":76},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_77","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月壬辰，熒惑犯亢南第二星。丙申，熒惑犯亢南星。","sentenceOrder":77},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_78","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月乙卯，熒惑入氐。","sentenceOrder":78},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_79","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三年二月乙卯，熒惑在房北頭第一星西北一尺，徘徊守房。","sentenceOrder":79},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_80","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月戊戌，熒惑犯。〔一０〕","sentenceOrder":80},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_81","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月乙亥，熒惑犯房。癸亥，熒惑犯天江南頭第二星。","sentenceOrder":81},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_82","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月丁巳，熒惑犯南斗第五星。","sentenceOrder":82},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_83","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月丙戌，熒惑從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":83},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_84","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年八月戊辰，熒惑入太微。癸酉，熒惑犯太微右執法。戊子，熒惑在太微。","sentenceOrder":84},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_85","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月戊申，熒惑犯歲星。己酉，熒惑犯歲星，芒角相接。","sentenceOrder":85},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_86","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月丁丑，熒惑犯亢南頭第一星。","sentenceOrder":86},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_87","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月庚寅，熒惑犯氐西南星。","sentenceOrder":87},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_88","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月己未，熒惑犯房北頭第一星。庚申，熒惑入房北犯鉤鈐星。","sentenceOrder":88},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_89","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五年二月乙亥，熒惑填星同在南斗度，為合宿。","sentenceOrder":89},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_90","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月乙未，熒惑從行在哭星東，相去半寸。","sentenceOrder":90},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_91","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六年四月癸丑，熒惑伏在參度，去太白二尺五寸，辰星去太白五尺，三星為合宿。甲戌，熒惑在辰星東南二尺五寸，俱從行，入東井曠中，無所犯。","sentenceOrder":91},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_92","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"閏四月丁丑，熒惑從行在氐西南星北七寸，為犯。己卯，熒惑從行入氐，無所犯。乙巳，熒惑從行在房北頭第一上將右驂星南六寸，為犯。又在鉤鈐星西北五寸。","sentenceOrder":92},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_93","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月丙寅，熒惑從行在歲星西，相去四尺，同在尾度，為合宿。","sentenceOrder":93},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_94","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七年二月丙子，熒惑從行在填星西，相去二尺，同在牽牛度，為合宿。","sentenceOrder":94},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_95","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月戊午，熒惑從在泣星西北七寸。戊辰，熒惑從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":95},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_96","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月戊戌，熒惑逆入羽林。","sentenceOrder":96},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_97","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月乙丑，熒惑入羽林，成句己。","sentenceOrder":97},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_98","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八年四月丙申，熒惑從行入輿鬼，在西北星東南二寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":98},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_99","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月乙亥，熒惑入氐。","sentenceOrder":99},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_100","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月乙未，熒惑從入北落門，在第一星東南，去鉤鈐三寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":100},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_101","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年三月甲午，熒惑從在填星東七寸，在歲星南六寸，同在虛度，為犯，為合宿。","sentenceOrder":101},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_102","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月癸亥，熒惑從行入羽林。","sentenceOrder":102},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_103","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"閏七月辛酉，熒惑從行在畢左股星西北一寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":103},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_104","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月十四日，熒惑應伏在昴三度，前先曆在畢度，二十一日始逆行北轉，垂及玄冬，熒惑囚死之時，而形色漸大於常。","sentenceOrder":104},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_105","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十年二月庚子，熒惑從入東井北轅西頭第一星西二寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":105},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_106","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月癸未，熒惑從行在輿鬼西北七寸，為犯。乙酉，熒惑從行入輿鬼。","sentenceOrder":106},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_107","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月壬寅，熒惑從行入太微。","sentenceOrder":107},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_108","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年二月庚戌，熒惑從在填星西北六寸，為犯，〔一一〕同在營室。","sentenceOrder":108},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_109","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月戊午，熒惑從行在歲星西南六寸，為犯，同在婁度。","sentenceOrder":109},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_110","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月辛巳，熒惑從行入東井，在南轅西第一星東北一尺四寸。","sentenceOrder":110},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_111","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月丁巳，熒惑逆行在五諸侯東星北四寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":111},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_112","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"隆昌元年三月乙丑，熒惑從行入輿鬼西北星東一寸，為犯。癸酉，熒惑從行在輿鬼積尸星東北七寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":112},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_113","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"閏三月甲寅，熒惑從入軒轅。","sentenceOrder":113},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_114","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月丁酉，熒惑從入太微，在右執法北二寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":114},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_115","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元四年正月己卯，歲星太白俱從行，同在婁度為合〔宿〕〔一二〕。","sentenceOrder":115},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_116","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月丁酉，歲星晝見。","sentenceOrder":116},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_117","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明元年五月甲午，歲星入東井。","sentenceOrder":117},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_118","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月壬午，歲星晝見。","sentenceOrder":118},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_119","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三年五月丙子，歲星與太白合。","sentenceOrder":119},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_120","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月辛丑，歲星與辰星合。","sentenceOrder":120},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_121","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月己巳，歲星從入太微。","sentenceOrder":121},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_122","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月甲子，歲星從入太微，犯右執法。","sentenceOrder":122},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_123","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年閏二月丙辰，歲星犯太微上將。","sentenceOrder":123},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_124","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月庚申，歲星犯太微上將。","sentenceOrder":124},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_125","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月己未，歲星犯右執法。","sentenceOrder":125},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_126","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月乙巳，歲星犯進賢，又與熒惑於軫度合宿。","sentenceOrder":126},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_127","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五年二月癸卯，歲星犯進賢。","sentenceOrder":127},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_128","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月甲子，歲星晝見在軫度。","sentenceOrder":128},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_129","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月己未，歲星從在氐西南星北七寸，又辰星從入氐，在歲星西四尺五寸，又太白從在辰星東，相去一尺，同在氐度，三星為合宿。","sentenceOrder":129},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_130","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月甲戌，歲星晝見。","sentenceOrder":130},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_131","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六年三月甲申，歲星逆行入氐宿。","sentenceOrder":131},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_132","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月丙寅，歲星晝見在氐度。","sentenceOrder":132},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_133","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八年三月庚申，歲星守牽牛。","sentenceOrder":133},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_134","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年二月壬午，歲星從在填星西七寸，同在虛度為合〔宿〕〔一三〕。","sentenceOrder":134},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_135","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"閏七月辛酉，歲星在泣星北五寸，為犯，又守填星。","sentenceOrder":135},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_136","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月辛卯，在泣星西一尺五寸，為合〔宿〕。〔一四〕","sentenceOrder":136},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_137","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明元年六月，辰星從行入太微，在太白西北一尺。","sentenceOrder":137},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_138","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年八月甲寅，辰星於翼犯太白。","sentenceOrder":138},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_139","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年六月丙子，辰星隨太白於西方，在七星度，相去一尺四寸，為合宿。","sentenceOrder":139},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_140","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年九月丙辰，辰星依曆應夕見西方亢宿一度，至九月八日不見。","sentenceOrder":140},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_141","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"隆昌元年正月丙戌，辰星見危度，在太白北一尺，為犯。","sentenceOrder":141},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_142","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元三年十月癸丑，填星逆行守氐。","sentenceOrder":142},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_143","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年七月戊辰，填星從行入氐。","sentenceOrder":143},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_144","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明元年正月庚寅，填星守房心。","sentenceOrder":144},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_145","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月甲子，填星逆行犯西咸星。","sentenceOrder":145},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_146","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年二月戊辰，填星犯東咸星。","sentenceOrder":146},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_147","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年十二月辛巳，填星犯建星。","sentenceOrder":147},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_148","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七年十二月戊辰，填星在須女度，又辰星從〔行〕在填星西南一尺一寸，〔一五〕為合宿。","sentenceOrder":148},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_149","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八年三月庚申，填星守哭尾。〔一六〕","sentenceOrder":149},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_150","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年七月庚戌，填星逆在泣西星東北七寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":150},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_151","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月甲午，填星從行在泣星西北五寸，為犯。","sentenceOrder":151},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_152","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"流星災","sentenceOrder":152},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_153","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元元年十月癸酉，有流星大如三升塸，色白，尾長五丈，從南河東北二尺出，北行歷輿鬼西過，未至軒轅後星而沒，沒後餘中央，曲如車輪，俄頃化為白雲，久乃滅。流星自下而升，名曰飛星。","sentenceOrder":153},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_154","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三年十月丙午，有流星大如月，赤白色，尾長七丈，西北行入紫宮中，光照牆垣。","sentenceOrder":154},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_155","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年正月辛未，有流星大如三升塸，赤色，從北極第二星北一尺出，北行一丈而沒。","sentenceOrder":155},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_156","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月壬子，流星如鵝卵，從柳北出，入軒轅。又一枚如瓜大，出西行沒空中。","sentenceOrder":156},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_157","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明元年六月己酉，有流星如二升碗，從紫宮出，南行沒氐。","sentenceOrder":157},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_158","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"二年三月庚辰，有流星如二升碗，從天市中出，南行在心後。","sentenceOrder":158},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_159","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年二月乙丑，有流星大如一升器。戊辰，有流星大如五升器。","sentenceOrder":159},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_160","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月丁卯，有流星大如一升器，從南斗東北出，西行經斗入氐。","sentenceOrder":160},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_161","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月丙戌，有流星大如鴨卵，從匏瓜南出，至虛而入。","sentenceOrder":161},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_162","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八月辛未，有流星大如三升塸，從觜星南出，西南行入天濛沒。","sentenceOrder":162},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_163","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月戊寅，有流星大如二升塸，白色，從亢東北出，行入天市。","sentenceOrder":163},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_164","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月丁巳，有流星大如三升碗，白色，從天市帝座出，東北行一丈而沒。","sentenceOrder":164},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_165","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五年六月辛未，有流星大如三升器，沒後有痕。","sentenceOrder":165},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_166","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月丙申，有流星大如四升器，白色，有光照地。","sentenceOrder":166},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_167","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月甲子，西北有流星大如鴨卵，黃白色，尾長六尺，西南行一丈餘沒。","sentenceOrder":167},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_168","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六年三月癸酉，有流星大如鴨卵，赤色，無尾。","sentenceOrder":168},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_169","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月丙辰，北面有流星大如二升器，白色，北行六尺而沒。","sentenceOrder":169},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_170","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月癸巳，有流星大如鵝卵，白色，從匏瓜南出，西南行一丈沒空中。須臾，又有流星大如五升器，白色，從北河南出，東北行一丈三尺沒空中。","sentenceOrder":170},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_171","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月戊寅，南面有流星，大如雞卵，赤色，在東南行沒，沒後如連珠。","sentenceOrder":171},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_172","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月壬寅，有流星大如鵝卵，黃白色，尾長三丈，有光，沒後有痕從梗河出，西行一丈許，沒空中。","sentenceOrder":172},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_173","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七年正月甲寅，有流星如五升器，白色，尾長四尺，從坐旗星出，西行入五車而過，沒空中。","sentenceOrder":173},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_174","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月丁丑，流星大如二升器，黃赤色，有光尾長六尺許，從亢南出，西行入翼中而沒，沒後如連珠。","sentenceOrder":174},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_175","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月乙丑，有流星如三升器，赤黃色，尾長六尺，出紫宮內北極星，東南行三丈沒空中。壬辰，流星如三升器，白色，有光從五車北出，行入紫宮，抵北極第一第二星而過，落空中，尾如連珠，仍有音響似雷。太史奏名曰「天狗」。","sentenceOrder":175},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_176","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八年四月癸巳，有流星如二升器，黃白色，有光，從心星南一尺許出，南行二丈沒，沒後如連珠。丁巳，流星如鵝〔卵〕，〔一七〕白色，長五丈許，從角星東北二尺出，西北行沒太微西蕃上將星閒。","sentenceOrder":176},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_177","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六月癸未，有流星如鴨卵，赤色，從紫宮中出，西南行未至大角五尺許沒。","sentenceOrder":177},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_178","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月戊申，有流星如五升器，赤白色，長七尺，東南行二丈，沒空中。","sentenceOrder":178},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_179","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十月乙亥，有流星如鵝卵，白色，從紫宮中出，西北行三丈許，沒空中。","sentenceOrder":179},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_180","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月乙未，有流星如鵝卵，赤白色，有光無尾，從氐北一丈出，南行入氐中沒。辛丑，流星如鵝卵，白色，從參伐出，南行一丈沒空中。又有一流星大如三升器，白色，從軫中出，東南行入婁中沒。","sentenceOrder":180},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_181","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年五月庚子，有流星如雞子，白色，無尾，從紫宮裏黃帝座星西二尺出，南行一丈沒空中。丁未，流星如李子，白色，無尾，從奎東北大星東二尺出，東北行至天將軍而沒。戊申，流星如鵝卵，黃白色，尾長二丈，從箕星東一尺出，南行四丈沒。","sentenceOrder":181},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_182","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月乙卯，西南有流星大如二升器，白色，無尾，西南行一丈餘沒。戊午，有流星如二升器，黃白色，有光從天江星西出，東北經天過入參中而沒，〔一八〕沒後如連珠。","sentenceOrder":182},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_183","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"閏七月戊辰，流星如鵝卵，赤色，尾長二尺，從文昌西行入紫宮沒。己巳，西南有流星如二升器，白色，西南行一丈沒。","sentenceOrder":183},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_184","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月戊子，有流星大如雞卵，白色，從少微星北頭出，東行入太微抵帝座星而過，未至東蕃次相一尺沒，如散珠。","sentenceOrder":184},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_185","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十年正月甲戌，有流星如五升器，白色，從氐中出，東南行經房道過，從心星南二尺沒。","sentenceOrder":185},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_186","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月癸未，有流星如雞卵，青白色，尾長四尺，從牽牛南八寸出，南行一丈沒空中。","sentenceOrder":186},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_187","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年二月壬寅，東北有流星如一升器，白色，無尾，北行三丈而沒。","sentenceOrder":187},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_188","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四月丙申，有流星如三升器，白色，有光，尾長一丈許，從箕星東北一尺出，行二丈許，入斗度，沒空中，臨沒如連珠。","sentenceOrder":188},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_189","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五月壬申，有流星大如雞子，黃白色，從太微端門出，無所犯，西南行一丈許沒，沒後有痕。","sentenceOrder":189},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_190","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七月辛酉，有流星如雞子，赤色，無尾，從氐中出，西行一丈五尺沒空中。戊寅，有流星如雞卵，黃白色，從紫宮東蕃內出，東北行一丈五尺，至北極第五星西北四尺沒。","sentenceOrder":190},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_191","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九月乙酉，有流星如鴨卵，黃白色，從婁南一尺出，東行二丈沒。","sentenceOrder":191},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_192","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月己丑，西南有流星如三升器，黃赤色，無尾，西南行三丈許沒，散如遺火。","sentenceOrder":192},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_193","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永元三年夜，天開黃色明照，須臾有物絳色如小甕，漸漸大如倉廩，聲隆隆如雷，墜太湖中，野雉皆雊，世人呼為「木殃」。史臣案春秋緯「天狗如大奔星，有聲，望之如火，見則四方相射」。漢史云：「西北有三大星，如日狀，名曰天狗。天狗出則人相食。」天官云：「天狗狀如大鏡星。」〔一九〕又云：「如大流星，色黃，有聲。其止地類狗所墜。望之如火光，炎炎衝天。其上銳，其下圓，如數頃田。見則流血千里，破軍殺將。」漢史又云：「照明下為天狗，所下兵起血流。」昭明，星也。洛書云：「昭明見而霸者出。」運斗樞云：「昭明有芒角，兵徵也。」河圖云：「太白散為天狗。」漢史又云：「有星出，其狀赤白有光，即為天狗，其下小無足，所下國易政。」眾說不同，未詳孰是。推亂亡之運，此其必天狗乎。","sentenceOrder":193},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_194","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"老人星","sentenceOrder":194},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_195","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元元年十一月戊辰，老人星見南方丙上。八月癸卯，祠老人星。〔二０〕","sentenceOrder":195},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_196","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明三年八月丁酉，老人星見南方丙上。","sentenceOrder":196},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_197","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六年八月壬戌，老人星見南方丙上。","sentenceOrder":197},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_198","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七年七月壬戌，老人星見南方丙上。","sentenceOrder":198},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_199","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"九年閏七月戊寅，老人星見南方丙上。","sentenceOrder":199},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_200","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十年八月乙酉，老人星見。","sentenceOrder":200},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_201","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年九月丙寅，老人星見南方丙上。","sentenceOrder":201},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_202","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"白虹雲氣","sentenceOrder":202},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_203","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元四年二月辛卯，白虹貫日。","sentenceOrder":203},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_204","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明十年七月癸酉，西方有白虹，須臾滅。","sentenceOrder":204},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_205","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年九月甲午，西方有白虹，南頭指申，北頭指戌上，久久消滅。","sentenceOrder":205},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_206","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"建元四年二月辛卯，黑氣大小二枚，東至卯，西至酉，廣五丈，久久消滅。","sentenceOrder":206},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_207","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明二年四月丁未，北斗第六第七星閒有一白氣。","sentenceOrder":207},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_208","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"四年正月辛未，黃白氣長丈五尺許，入太微。","sentenceOrder":208},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_209","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"永明四年正月癸未，南面有陣雲一丈許。","sentenceOrder":209},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_210","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"五年四月己巳，有雲色黑，廣五尺，東頭指丑，西頭指酉，並至地。","sentenceOrder":210},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_211","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一月乙巳，東南有陣雲高一丈，北至卯，東南至巳，久久散漫。","sentenceOrder":211},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_212","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"六年二月癸亥，東西有一梗雲半天，曲向西，蒼白色。","sentenceOrder":212},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_213","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"三月庚辰，南面有梗雲，黑色，廣六寸。","sentenceOrder":213},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_214","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"七年十月辛未，有梗雲，蒼黑色，東頭至寅，西頭指酉，廣三尺，貫紫宮，久久消沒。","sentenceOrder":214},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_215","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"八年十一月乙未，有梗雲，黑色，六尺許，東頭至卯，西頭至酉，久久散漫。","sentenceOrder":215},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_216","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十二月庚辰，南面有陣雲，黑色，高一丈許，東頭至巳，西頭至未，久久散漫。","sentenceOrder":216},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_217","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"十一年七月丙辰，東面有梗雲，蒼白色，廣二尺三寸，南頭指巳至地，北頭指子至地，久久漸散漫。","sentenceOrder":217},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_218","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"贊曰：陽精火鏡，陰靈水存。有稟有射，代為明昏。垂光滿蓋，列景周渾。具位臣輔，備象街門。災生霣薄，祟起飛奔。弗忘人懼，瑜瑕辯論。若任天道，灶亦多言。","sentenceOrder":218},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_219","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"校勘記","sentenceOrder":219},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_220","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一〕　五星從伏　錢大昕廿二史考異云：「梁武帝父名順之，故子顯修史，多易為『從』字。如天文志『五星從伏』、『熒惑從行』、『歲星太白俱從行』、『辰星從行』之類。」","sentenceOrder":220},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_221","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔二〕　六（年）〔月〕辛卯　張森楷校勘記云：「年非所以繫日，且建元無六年，『年』必是『月』之訛。」今據改。","sentenceOrder":221},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_222","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔三〕　在右執法星西北一尺　「右」永樂大典七千八百五十六引作「左」。","sentenceOrder":222},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_223","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔四〕　五月癸卯太白晝見當午上　大典引此下有「己丑太白晝見當午」八字。","sentenceOrder":223},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_224","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔五〕　太白從行在房南第二左股次將星西南一尺為犯　殿本考證云：「『左股』係『左服』之訛。房四星主車駕，南星曰左驂，次左服，故曰第二左服。」","sentenceOrder":224},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_225","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔六〕　六（年）〔月〕戊子　據毛本、局本改。","sentenceOrder":225},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_226","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔七〕　七月乙丑太白從行在軒轅大星東八寸為犯　大典引此下有「九月己酉太白晝見當午上」十一字。","sentenceOrder":226},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_227","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔八〕　熒惑（後）〔從〕行在太微　據毛本、殿本、局本改。","sentenceOrder":227},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_228","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔九〕　癸未熒惑犯太微右執法丁酉熒惑犯太微右執法　殿本考證云：「按癸未至丁酉計十五日，不書逆行，熒惑安能兩犯右執法。意者先犯左執法，次犯右執法耶？」","sentenceOrder":228},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_229","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一０〕四月戊戌熒惑犯　殿本考證云：「『犯』字下必有闕文。」","sentenceOrder":229},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_230","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一一〕熒惑從在填星西北六寸為犯　「填」原訛「鎮」，今據毛本、局本改正。","sentenceOrder":230},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_231","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一二〕同在婁度為合〔宿〕　據南監本、毛本、殿本、局本補。","sentenceOrder":231},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_232","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一三〕同在虛度為合〔宿〕　據南監本、毛本、殿本、局本補。","sentenceOrder":232},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_233","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一四〕在泣星西一尺五寸為合〔宿〕　據南監本、毛本、殿本、局本補。","sentenceOrder":233},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_234","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一五〕又辰星從〔行〕在填星西南一尺一寸　據南監本、局本補。","sentenceOrder":234},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_235","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一六〕填星守哭尾　「哭尾」南監本、毛本、殿本、局本作「哭星」。","sentenceOrder":235},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_236","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一七〕流星如鵝〔卵〕　據南監本、毛本、殿本、局本補。","sentenceOrder":236},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_237","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一八〕東北經天過入參中而沒　毛本、殿本、局本無「過」字。","sentenceOrder":237},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_238","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔一九〕天官云天狗狀如大鏡星　殿本考證云：「大鏡星無考。天官書原文『狀如大奔星』為是。」","sentenceOrder":238},{"id":"s_work_nam_te_13_239","chapterId":"ch_work_nam_te_13","textTraditional":"〔二０〕建元元年十一月戊辰老人星見南方丙上八月癸卯祠老人星　按建元元年十二月戊辰朔，是十一月無戊辰也。又是年八月庚午朔，無癸卯，且八月不應在十二月後，必有訛。","sentenceOrder":239}],"overrides":{}}